  "text": "[calm] The one layer with ruled, mortared joints. The loop is parked here — parked, not buried. It waits while older debts are repaired: the map, the flattened hierarchy. [short pause] What runs instead is drawn beside it — a different engine, the loop's method distilled into a skill. Watch the shape: a worker takes one task and returns a small report. An orchestrator verifies independently — re-runs the gates, never trusts the claim — writes the ledger, and replans after every step. [short pause] Two hatches, both the orchestrator's. At a real design fork it fans out into a planning cycle — parallel explorers, a judge, new tasks spliced into the plan — no human woken. At a genuine human decision, it stops. That is this engine's overseer: an intelligent loop outside the loop, keeping the run healthy. The skill's own advice: copy it; don't reinvent the return channel. [pause] First target: the map you just watched evolve. Forty-four tasks, two days; interrupted runs resumed from the ledger as if nothing happened. It also caught the second thing the inside couldn't see — the hierarchy had gone flat — and folded ninety-six front-door rows down to sixty-two. [short pause] Then it built the talk you watched before this one. I did not plan that symmetry. I only kept the notes.",
